From 85e9950f46ac0cfa1b61ca0bf54934b3ef499ce0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mrdindon <5002201+Mrdindon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:51:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/24] rootfs_script: run <camera>/post-build.sh when the
 profile has one

Lets a camera profile adjust the final target tree (after overlays),
e.g. drop parts of the stock web UI it replaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 scripts/rootfs_script.sh | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/scripts/rootfs_script.sh b/scripts/rootfs_script.sh
index e833ba5..814b4c0 100755
--- a/scripts/rootfs_script.sh
+++ b/scripts/rootfs_script.sh
@@ -190,3 +190,11 @@ fi
 # Thingino disables CONFIG_LONG_OPTS; --long-options silently fail at runtime.
 # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 $BR2_EXTERNAL/scripts/check-busybox-lopts.sh "${TARGET_DIR}" 1
+
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Camera-specific post-build step: <camera profile>/post-build.sh <target>
+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+CAMERA_POST_BUILD="$BR2_EXTERNAL/${CAMERA_SUBDIR}/${CAMERA}/post-build.sh"
+if [ -x "$CAMERA_POST_BUILD" ]; then
+	"$CAMERA_POST_BUILD" "${TARGET_DIR}"
+fi
